OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1786646905
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway warns passengers
OL,4,Cto expect disruption amid heatwave
OL,6,FTrain operator East Midlands Railway
OL,7,Fis suspending some services and has
OL,8,Furged passengers to avoid the highest
OL,9,Ftemperatures.
OL,11,FThe railway operator has said
OL,12,Fcustomers should only travel on
OL,13,FThursday (13 August) if their journey
OL,14,Fis essential.
OL,16,FThey are being encouraged to travel
OL,17,Fbefore midday to avoid the highest
OL,18,Ftemperatures and say that disruption
OL,19,Fis expected across the network.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/5
