PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1786646905
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway warns passengers
OL,4,Cto expect disruption amid heatwave
OL,6,FTo help maintain fleet availability
OL,7,Facross the network, they say the
OL,8,Ffollowing services will be disrupted:
OL,10,FEast Midlands Railway said they are
OL,11,Fworking closely with Network Rail to
OL,12,Fmonitor conditions and keep services
OL,13,Frunning safely.
OL,15,FIt comes as the UK Health and Security
OL,16,FAgency (UKHSA) has issued an amber
OL,17,Fheat-health alert across six regions
OL,18,Fof England, from Wednesday 12 to
OL,19,FFriday 14, August.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/5
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,347,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1786646905
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway warns passengers
OL,4,Cto expect disruption amid heatwave
OL,6,FThe railway operator say that the
OL,7,Ftemporary timetable services will help
OL,8,Fto keep services running safely and
OL,9,Freliably.
OL,11,FThey say the changes are being made to
OL,12,Freduce the impact of the extreme
OL,13,Ftemperatures on the railway, with some
OL,14,Fservices also expected to operate at
OL,15,Freduced speeds for safety reasons.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/5
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
