FL,347,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1786646905
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway warns passengers
OL,4,Cto expect disruption amid heatwave
OL,6,FPhilippa Cresswell, Customer
OL,7,FExperience Director at East Midlands
OL,8,FRailway, said: "The hot weather means
OL,9,Fwe'll need to make some temporary
OL,10,Fchanges to our services to keep the
OL,11,Frailway operating safely.
OL,13,F"If you do need to travel and the
OL,14,Fjourney is essential, we'd recommend
OL,15,Ftravelling before midday and checking
OL,16,Fyour journey before setting off.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/5
