PN,34605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1786646905
OL,3,CEast Midlands Railway warns passengers
OL,4,Cto expect disruption amid heatwave
OL,6,F"We appreciate these changes may
OL,7,Finconvenience some customers and we'd
OL,8,Flike to thank everyone for their
OL,9,Fpatience and understanding while we
OL,10,Fwork to keep people moving safely."
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/5
